WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.364 --> 00:00:05.058
This is Groundwork. Everything you see here belongs to a made-up sample household.

2
00:00:05.562 --> 00:00:09.871
To ask about your money, type in the Ask box at the top, in your own words.

3
00:00:10.497 --> 00:00:15.147
Press Enter. The dots mean Groundwork is reading your records, on this computer.

4
00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:23.361
There is no Chase Visa in these records. So instead of guessing, Groundwork asks which card you meant.

5
00:00:23.864 --> 00:00:28.046
Press Yes, and it answers. Your answer is kept, so it will not ask again.

6
00:00:33.857 --> 00:00:41.302
It works out the payoff with the same engine as the Debt Payoff page, and checks every budget line against what was actually spent.

7
00:00:41.804 --> 00:00:50.081
Every figure is written by Groundwork, from your own records. The AI only chooses which sentences to show, so it cannot make a number up.

8
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:54.594
And when your records hold too little to answer, it says it does not know yet.

9
00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:57.016
Nothing you ask leaves your computer.

